{
    "id": "isaacs-pf2e-automation",
    "title": "Isaac's PF2e Automation",
    "description": "<p>Automation for the Pathfinder Second Edition system. <strong>Area targeting</strong>: an ability with an area is placed as a Scene Region, aimed, and the creatures it catches become your targets before the card is posted. <strong>Stage pipelines</strong>: one wrap each on casting, damage, checks, rerolls, character preparation and detection modes, so other modules add stages instead of competing wrappers. <strong>Allowances</strong>: a spell's frequency is enforced and spent, a feat or action at zero uses is refused, and ISO-interval frequencies refill as world time passes.</p>",
    "version": "99.0.0",
    "license": "./LICENSE",
    "authors": [
        {
            "name": "Isaac",
            "url": "https://github.com/zarex97/isaacs-pf2e-automation",
            "flags": {}
        }
    ],
    "url": "https://github.com/zarex97/isaacs-pf2e-automation",
    "bugs": "https://github.com/zarex97/isaacs-pf2e-automation/issues",
    "manifest": "https://github.com/zarex97/isaacs-pf2e-automation/releases/latest/download/module.json",
    "download": "https://github.com/zarex97/isaacs-pf2e-automation/releases/latest/download/module.zip",
    "compatibility": {
        "minimum": "14.361",
        "verified": "14.364",
        "maximum": "14"
    },
    "relationships": {
